Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Singer, Hein, Host
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:20.36,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,That night the whole room smelled of jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:29.04,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The smell even soaked into his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.26,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:01.84,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:04.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,As a last resort, there is a left sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:16.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It’s you that I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:18.02,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,4 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.59,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:25.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Glad you like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.43,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He did not leave me to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:32.77,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,do I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:36.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, why have you turned pale?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:37.37,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,And sweated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:42.08,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:44.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Tired because I didn’t sleep all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:48.58,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,In this case, tea will be beneficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:51.62,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Drink and go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:08.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You can drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.80,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’ll pour it myself. You can be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:35.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Drink. It smells very tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:51.84,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend I don’t know. This is the only way I can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.35,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Why is he trying to persuade you to drink tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.09,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Really poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Tastes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:11.83,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,very pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:15.60,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:18.74,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Have you had dinner lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.78,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The poison will act faster on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:24.58,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,So he asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:27.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You were wondering what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:29.62,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I was busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:31.99,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,But I was always interested
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.15,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,you and your relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.46,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,drink too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:46.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,As a sign of sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.05,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Not poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,She said it herself, as a sign of sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:21.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.54,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Let me go, I need to clear my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:29.08,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Do you think I poisoned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.91,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Why? Is there any reason to think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.25,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Let's wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If nothing happens to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.92,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,my innocence will be proven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:42.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What if I don’t want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:52.60,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If you are poisoned, your tongue will go numb first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You will feel numb,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.80,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,don’t hesitate and strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:05:59.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Do you think I can’t?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.97,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:04.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.45,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Understood correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.25,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If I die, at least not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:21.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,4 episode: The Man Who Knew Too Much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:31.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-I can’t do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.11,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Even if my life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.84,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I will die soon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:45.25,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.52,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Will you hurt me in my sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.56,0:06:51.76,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Something is wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.29,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What did you give me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.16,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:06:59.17,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Where did you go when I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:01.30,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,went to the summer palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.77,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I want to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.80,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We need to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:09.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I can’t die when the exit is right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:20.69,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What happened to you that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:24.52,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This is dangerous. You need to be silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:25.89,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:28.36,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,That night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.00,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,you tried
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.84,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:38.87,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,She knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:41.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If you knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:44.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,why didn’t you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:46.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I didn’t even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:52.75,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Just found out, thanks to your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:56.69,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.63,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If I had known earlier, I would definitely have killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Spawn of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.93,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Even if you are crazy about someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.27,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,why kill your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:09.20,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Do you call yourself a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.87,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin is your concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.37,0:08:14.44,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You can’t just indulge in adultery?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:17.34,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Were you going to kill your wife with your own hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,She doesn’t know the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:24.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:28.62,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,That night you heard something you shouldn’t have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:30.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:34.46,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Answer! What did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:39.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,So that’s not the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.74,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You have a good reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:47.11,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,to kill this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.21,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Did I understand correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:52.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Don’t be deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:54.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Is it because I heard something,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:55.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,or because of love for another woman -
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.82,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,one reason for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.45,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’m just weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:05.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If I were stronger, you wouldn’t attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.83,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm easy to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:09.76,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,because I'm weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:12.27,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,This is the real reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Come on. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:24.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Prove that you just kill those who are weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.23,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm beside myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:45.83,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.50,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He didn't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:54.14,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If I were myself, I would knock him out with one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:55.27,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:36.85,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:41.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I always thought that I was a weakling who fights someone who is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:45.02,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Therefore, I believed that any techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.69,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.90,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The Queen knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:57.94,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that I tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:09.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I thought there were many reasons\N for killing the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.28,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Not only because of the overheard conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:15.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,But also because she contributed to tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:19.49,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,So I thought I could kill the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:27.13,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,However, this was a cowardly excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.40,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I am not ready to fight strong opponents,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:33.11,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,so I targeted the weak queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:37.68,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-If I attack the weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:41.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,how am I different from the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.42,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Focus on the righteous goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:50.79,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,All means are good for a good purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:54.26,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The Kim clan cannot be defeated with righteous methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:01.83,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Don’t doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:04.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’m sure their plans are insidious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:07.44,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Only the queen knows about this now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.07,0:12:10.31,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,just guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,She needs to be silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:15.05,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Sooner or later everything will become clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:20.12,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I will no longer use cowardly tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:21.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:24.36,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I condemned the queen because she is from the Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:27.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,However, she behaved unpredictably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:31.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,In general, I am not who you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.03,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Appearances can be deceiving, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:36.97,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The Queen said she was a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Perhaps she was trying to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:43.78,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,that she is molded from a different dough and acts differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.71,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What can you expect from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:47.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The Queen is the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:49.65,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,like the rest of the Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.52,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Maybe I’m a puppet king,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:56.39,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,but the queen’s words will give them nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:58.46,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There is no conclusive evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:02.43,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I'll see what the queen does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.93,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,At the same time, I’ll find out what kind of person she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:22.58,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I found out where this fabric came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:24.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,she is from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:29.12,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If someone tried to steal her from the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:31.12,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,he would definitely have been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:35.39,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,That is, a mere mortal cannot do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:40.33,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Lord. I wonder how much they will pay me for my services.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:43.00,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It was not easy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:47.91,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:54.15,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,From now on, trust me with the heaviest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:56.22,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:00.71,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Due to one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:05.72,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,we \Nwill not win over the king as a noble wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:10.92,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We need something that will melt his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:16.46,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The vulnerable spot of the concubine is an incident on the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:19.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:22.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,We need to find a scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.74,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Weak and helpless,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,like a fawn without a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:34.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Someone similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.09,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Where did the tudjon player go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:21.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Can’t you put the card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:25.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You wouldn’t notice even if I stole your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.07,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.47,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.94,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Something is bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:39.08,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There are too many villains wandering outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:42.25,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I made friends with one guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.38,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.15,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.55,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,he was also attacked by the villain,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.26,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,walking outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.29,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,"Also"? Who else was attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.63,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You know, I’m very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:57.50,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,My cousin Benin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.63,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,seems to be trying
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:05.04,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,find someone using a piece of fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,My gut tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:12.24,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,owner of a piece of clothing, a notorious villain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:13.88,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:16.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.42,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and ran into my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:27.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,It’s in vain to have a talent like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:29.19,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,didn’t become a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:31.33,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,A huge loss for the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:36.64,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You are as insightful as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:45.04,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Something strange is happening outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:01.79,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:04.86,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I’ll do what you ask. Don't kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.10,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.23,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:12.30,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I don’t know who you are, but I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:13.67,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.51,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I don’t see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:19.78,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Raise your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:23.02,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.86,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You still won’t see my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:47.11,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,An influential person is waiting for your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:51.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I don’t know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:54.21,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,How do I know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.18,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:58.98,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,who tried to harm the queen by pushing her into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:02.75,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,You will survive if you say the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.81,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.41,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Tastes terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.41,0:20:02.11,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,but very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.05,0:20:12.06,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,The queen's father brought something yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:13.66,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I drink on an empty stomach
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:16.09,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,and I feel rejuvenated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:20.53,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,He always knows where to get something unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:23.57,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,As an advisor to the royal kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:25.37,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,it brings the most
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:26.61,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,suitable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.02,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:43.86,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,what about our affairs in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.73,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,There is a person in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:48.23,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.33,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I see. As soon as it's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.70,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,for me it will be one less thing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.44,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:01.01,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,No mistakes allowed this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:18.32,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,Kim Byunin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:21.13,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,trying to find a person
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.56,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,a piece of the king’s clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:30.94,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,I destroyed the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:34.54,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,But since the queen found out the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:37.48,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,If Benin finds out everything and comes for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.81,0:21:40.25,Default,LILY,0,0,0,,so I made a mistake about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:42.45,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Such games are too dangerous.\N-I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:46.08,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But if I'm right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.12,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,then an innocent person will not suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:56.93,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Today is my father-in-law’s first day in office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:08.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.47,0:22:11.61,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I thought you were still in the Daejeon hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:13.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Came here to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:17.78,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I need to share important knowledge with Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Are you that shocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:31.00,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:34.20,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:46.08,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:48.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I thought he was just a fool, and this is all a performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:51.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Did the king try to kill the queen with his own hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.55,0:22:54.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If I start such a huge scandal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:56.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I’ll find myself at the epicenter, this is even more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:22:59.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I’ll wait until the lake is filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.69,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Until then I will keep my head down and return to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:04.86,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your hands are probably numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:06.47,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Keep crossed for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:09.37,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,This calms me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:16.21,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Thoughts do not calm down, although I want to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:18.94,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What did he put in my tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:21.48,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I knew it. You can't relax for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:25.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But if he wanted to finish me off, he could have simply poisoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:27.62,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.62,0:23:28.99,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,To hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:30.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Why should I worry about this patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:34.59,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Let's check how things are going with the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:36.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Do you have some kind of whip?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.96,0:23:38.46,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,We need to hurry them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:39.63,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:49.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen invites you to her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.37,0:23:53.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I don’t need her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.05,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.41,0:24:22.77,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Infuriating. What more does she want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:23.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.17,0:24:59.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Continue. Everything will work out! Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:02.15,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:04.42,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Here.\N-Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.72,0:25:06.12,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Liver, livelier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.12,0:25:08.32,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,More lively. We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:10.06,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Urgently. Let's hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.06,0:25:12.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:16.70,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Be careful. Move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:21.07,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I can’t stand it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.07,0:25:22.87,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I'm going to the restroom. I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.13,0:25:24.90,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,So much work. Come back quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:26.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,More lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.61,0:25:36.25,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I heard that you were coming, so I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.35,0:25:39.15,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:43.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother is very interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:45.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It is an honor for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.12,0:25:48.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I heard your younger brother is in slavery
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.26,0:25:49.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,due to family debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:52.76,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes. In the whole world I only have a brother left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.23,0:25:55.23,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I heard you are very worried
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:58.07,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,and you will do anything to restore
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.07,0:25:59.37,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,the position of her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:02.74,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I save money as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.41,0:26:05.51,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But the debt is very large.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:08.68,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Because the Queen Mother appreciates you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.68,0:26:10.12,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,she proposes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.15,0:26:13.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You won’t have such a chance again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.42,0:26:19.72,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,How long will it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.99,0:26:22.49,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:27.27,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Make her admit it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.43,0:26:30.00,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The person who sent the letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:32.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,queen mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.74,0:26:35.77,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.61,0:26:39.21,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If I take the blame for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.21,0:26:41.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,my brother and I won’t survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.91,0:26:44.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,No need to worry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.45,0:26:45.62,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your dedication
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:48.39,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,gives him a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.62,0:26:49.69,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:53.06,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,How long do you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.79,0:26:56.80,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,will he be able to endure such a hard life?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.33,0:27:00.93,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What if something bad happens tomorrow, like an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.67,0:27:05.74,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Anything bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:16.78,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You called me, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.58,0:27:19.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I invited you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:22.65,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,because I want to entrust you with something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.85,0:27:25.09,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn, what else? What a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:27.99,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It’s too early for me to take responsibility in important matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.99,0:27:30.46,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,because there is still a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.43,0:27:33.33,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:35.33,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.63,0:27:38.34,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I wanted to choose the most graceful concubines for the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.34,0:27:41.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,who can amaze and charm the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:43.74,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I guess there is no choice but to figure it out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:45.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Mengzi said,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:48.38,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,that virtuous people enjoy support.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:49.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Develop virtue - you will get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.22,0:27:51.68,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Even though I have a lot to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:54.19,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,many are ready to help me \Nthanks to my virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:57.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,So I will try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.96,0:27:59.06,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.42,0:28:02.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,what is the maximum number of concubines?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:04.40,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Maximum?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.66,0:28:07.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, how many
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.33,0:28:10.07,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,can we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.74,0:28:13.34,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I don’t even know. According to the classics,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.47,0:28:16.84,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,there should be 6 concubines of the first rank, 3 of the second,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.84,0:28:19.44,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,9 third, 27 fourth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:21.65,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,and 81 fifth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:24.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-who will serve the king.\N-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.72,0:28:27.42,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,6 plus 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:29.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,9.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:30.76,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,27.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.26,0:28:32.62,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And 81?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.53,0:28:36.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But we need to be restrained, we’ll choose only 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.33,0:28:37.63,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.73,0:28:40.97,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:43.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.40,0:28:45.97,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,His Majesty already has a concubine,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:48.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,you need to select 2 more, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.04,0:28:50.54,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,No, we will choose 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.68,0:28:54.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The concubine brought with her the court lady Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.11,0:28:57.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yeah, that girl who runs after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.65,0:28:59.32,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,She said something crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.65,0:29:01.79,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,out of devotion to the concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.49,0:29:04.86,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Why did you jump into the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:07.29,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,right in front of Cho Hwajin to defame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.29,0:29:08.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Spread such rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:13.63,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The king lied to protect Hwajin, and she ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.57,0:29:15.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,King?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:18.54,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I'm going to deprive the king of his favorite toy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:21.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,so I want to give him new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.31,0:29:27.78,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes. I also want you to prepare lunch for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:31.05,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I can no longer eat something that was prepared by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.98,0:29:34.15,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn, this is somehow not very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:40.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And if you eat healthy food prepared by me every day
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.29,0:29:43.40,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,and you’ll start looking younger than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.76,0:29:45.83,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.44,0:29:57.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You need to maintain good relations with her until the lake is filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.74,0:30:05.34,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Everything happened exactly as Kim So-yeon wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.08,0:30:08.11,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,She drove Hwajin into a real trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.55,0:30:11.88,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hey, girl. This will come back to haunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.18,0:30:14.92,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.89,0:30:18.06,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But what's the difference? \NI won't care when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:19.56,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,There is no time to worry about others yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.56,0:30:21.46,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You should sort yourself out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.29,0:30:24.53,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,More lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.93,0:30:28.40,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You two can take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.53,0:30:30.20,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You will crash again, get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.81,0:30:35.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Liver, livelier!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.21,0:30:39.78,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Liver, livelier!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Liver, livelier! Yes, yes! Even more alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.97,0:31:03.23,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.48,0:31:15.11,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn, this is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.48,0:31:17.85,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Only high society has such goodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:21.25,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Royal Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.96,0:31:25.56,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.10,0:31:33.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.57,0:31:35.97,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Last day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.23,0:31:38.10,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Dreary, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:41.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure you can do a much better job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:42.87,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.61,0:31:48.45,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What a wonderful horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.45,0:31:54.49,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,This is a gift from His Majesty to the commander of the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.02,0:31:56.29,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:32:00.23,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Come on. How many years have passed since I last rode a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:04.30,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And the position is not officially mine,\Nuntil I receive a certificate today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.06,0:32:07.27,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Well, next time.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.23,0:32:12.10,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Kim. Can you ride a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.67,0:32:14.74,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.41,0:32:19.48,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I am His Majesty’s best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:22.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And the maids consider me \None of the 5 most charming...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.28,0:32:25.25,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You don’t need to know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.58,0:32:27.65,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong was not even included in the rating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:30.29,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But your physique
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.29,0:32:32.79,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,not very suitable for riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.86,0:32:34.86,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And what a tall horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.86,0:32:36.83,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,At least jump on her with your short legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.37,0:32:42.43,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.67,0:32:44.00,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes in the old days
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.70,0:32:46.44,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I was jumping without hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.44,0:32:48.37,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,That's how good he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.37,0:32:50.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,He was sitting astride in a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.01,0:32:53.21,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,One day I fell asleep on a horse and even saw dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.28,0:32:56.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:59.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I’ll prove it to you. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.52,0:33:05.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You don’t have to do this.\N Don’t force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.36,0:33:07.33,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:09.83,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.37,0:33:15.60,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It seems wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:20.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hey, can you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.41,0:33:22.31,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.15,0:33:29.75,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What did you see? It couldn't be simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:45.23,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.10,0:33:48.23,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:03.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, you big cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.05,0:34:05.48,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:08.12,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Mr. Kim!\N-My legs! Legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:10.42,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Little feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.52,0:34:13.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Potatoes, salt and milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.29,0:34:15.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.13,0:34:17.86,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Never heard of this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.86,0:34:21.47,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Also called milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.67,0:34:22.87,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:25.44,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Such a rare ingredient,\Nit sinks like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:26.94,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You will not have oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.41,0:34:29.47,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Do you have black pepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.64,0:34:30.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.38,0:34:35.05,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,More valuable than gold, but sinks like sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.05,0:34:38.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But she won’t listen to me,\Nso I won’t say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.88,0:34:41.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I hear, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.66,0:34:46.22,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Oh, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.22,0:34:49.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I told you not to rush. Why did you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.86,0:34:54.33,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi was also in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.73,0:34:57.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,She is not young. What if you fainted and collapsed while running?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.17,0:34:59.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I'm there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.07,0:35:03.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Perhaps I’m a little slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.04,0:35:05.14,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,but I will never faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.05,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What a stubborn lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.62,0:35:21.43,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Okay, pour it.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.84,0:35:33.87,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And that’s all?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:37.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?\N-Well, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.94,0:35:41.71,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is a very rare thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.98,0:35:43.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,That’s why I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.12,0:35:45.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,In cooking, products decide everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.15,0:35:49.42,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If you milk everything, the calves will starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.89,0:35:51.39,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And caring too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.46,0:35:53.29,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damn, sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.56,0:35:56.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Have you heard about fasting days?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.13,0:35:58.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Intermittent fasting is good for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:01.83,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Fill my cauldron from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.40,0:36:05.14,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Be at least one drop less... You know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.91,0:36:10.24,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:17.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hmmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:20.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.22,0:36:22.82,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,How dare the girl show up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:33.80,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.60,0:36:39.70,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.70,0:36:41.31,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:43.94,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You are raising a puppy in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:47.61,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The dog has a higher status than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.01,0:36:50.65,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Envoys from Min. brought the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.65,0:36:53.25,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,They said it was a rare breed or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:57.12,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Min? This was 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:37:00.73,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If during these centuries the breed mixed with others,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.73,0:37:03.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,then it’s just a mongrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.36,0:37:05.66,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And what’s his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.96,0:37:07.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,The dog doesn’t have a name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.90,0:37:09.57,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Really? Then
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.70,0:37:13.24,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-let's call him the Demon.\N-Demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.50,0:37:14.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:16.94,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,So, let’s write.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.91,0:37:23.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,P - E - S. Replace p with a paired consonant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.81,0:37:25.42,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,PES
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.44,0:37:26.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,B
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:28.75,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,E
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.65,0:37:31.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And we have a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.36,0:37:33.69,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Therefore Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.69,0:37:36.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.33,0:37:42.53,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You come here often, probably hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.60,0:37:45.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.51,0:37:49.54,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.04,0:37:54.31,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:58.98,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.02,0:38:03.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.03,0:38:10.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why don’t you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.19,0:38:12.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Because it's too beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:16.17,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. This is not for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.17,0:38:18.50,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,As soon as you eat it, help me with the potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.50,0:38:19.54,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You can’t do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.67,0:38:23.24,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I am ready to put up with your presence, because you are a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.24,0:38:24.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,For a long time, women do not dare
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.78,0:38:26.81,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,touch the royal food.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.81,0:38:28.41,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,They are allowed to decorate dishes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.41,0:38:29.81,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and serve them on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.81,0:38:32.15,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Rootless and without official position...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:34.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This child
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:38.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,cannot help with cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.79,0:38:43.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What an old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.66,0:38:47.20,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And you try it. "Old fart".
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.20,0:38:49.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Old fart.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.03,0:38:51.84,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Wow, you said it so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.90,0:38:54.57,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Now call him an old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.37,0:38:56.57,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don’t get distracted. Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:03.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It feels like I’m eating a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.25,0:39:07.29,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Excellent comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.65,0:39:09.79,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You could host the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.66,0:39:11.69,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Pf.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.16,0:39:15.63,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,By the way, isn’t she too young for the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.69,0:39:18.86,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Her parents didn't pay taxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.86,0:39:20.10,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,so it was taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.10,0:39:22.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Everyone in her family became slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.63,0:39:25.64,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and her so-called father ran away cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.64,0:39:28.04,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Wow. What kind of father is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.41,0:39:30.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Royal Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.38,0:39:32.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Do you have no conscience at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.51,0:39:36.65,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.65,0:39:39.62,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don’t pay attention to all the bad things, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:43.62,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Doo-cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.32,0:39:45.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.99,0:39:47.12,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.99,0:39:50.33,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What? Fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.49,0:39:51.66,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.68,0:40:07.24,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why are potato balls so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.88,0:40:09.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,When will they bring the milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.61,0:40:11.75,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.22,0:40:19.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I milked all the cows to the very last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:26.26,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:28.73,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.21,0:40:37.74,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Milk porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:48.49,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why do you add potatoes to your porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.49,0:40:49.62,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.79,0:40:52.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Are you my mother-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.06,0:40:53.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Mothers-in-law should not interfere with their daughters-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.96,0:40:55.96,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.19,0:40:58.76,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why shouldn’t mothers-in-law mess with their daughters-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.76,0:41:00.26,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:08.17,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:22.72,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'll bring it to her personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.79,0:41:56.02,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Simply delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.42,0:42:00.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.56,0:42:04.26,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,as the potatoes cool down, they become hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.83,0:42:07.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,And the milk porridge splashed on the plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.67,0:42:09.20,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is all, of course, unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:10.67,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,But I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.44,0:42:13.47,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,nobody is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:19.94,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It is impossible to prepare the perfect dish
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.94,0:42:21.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,without proper service.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.78,0:42:24.95,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How should I serve the dish without it getting cold
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.95,0:42:26.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and it didn’t spill?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.78,0:42:28.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Here is the main question.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:22.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Let's ask the experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.51,0:43:27.51,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.51,0:43:29.05,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why haven't you pasted this yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.05,0:43:30.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Are you still not finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.71,0:43:32.95,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What are you doing?\N-Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.19,0:43:40.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.19,0:43:41.23,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.86,0:43:48.70,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Palanquin. I need a palanquin for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.70,0:43:49.70,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.07,0:43:52.14,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.47,0:43:53.57,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.57,0:43:55.31,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Palanquin for food?\N-Palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.31,0:43:57.54,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What kind of palanquin for food?\N-A palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.84,0:44:00.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.78,0:44:02.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What?\N-A palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.95,0:44:04.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What are you whispering there?\N-A palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.65,0:44:06.85,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What?\N-A palanquin for food?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:09.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.72,0:44:11.76,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.96,0:44:13.99,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.09,0:44:16.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.16,0:44:20.86,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Gathered together. One-two.\N-One-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.86,0:44:24.50,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.50,0:44:26.30,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.30,0:44:29.31,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.31,0:44:31.04,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-What? And that's all?\N-One-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:32.98,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.98,0:44:34.14,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two.\N-One-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.14,0:44:35.88,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Were you working all night?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.88,0:44:37.25,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,We worked in shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.25,0:44:39.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,They collected water and poured it into the lake all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.68,0:44:41.29,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,But the lake is very large.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.29,0:44:42.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two.\N-One-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.32,0:44:44.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It took a day to drain the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.19,0:44:45.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why does it take so long to fill?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.59,0:44:47.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,The lake is on a hill, so
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.59,0:44:50.23,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,it’s easy to drain - just make a well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.40,0:44:54.10,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I bet they relaxed,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:55.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,because there is no caretaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.57,0:44:58.74,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two.\N-One-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.58,0:45:08.18,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Maybe after we finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,shall we have a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.68,0:45:13.75,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.75,0:45:15.72,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What do you think? A?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:19.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I asked you a question! These are the brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.29,0:45:21.63,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.86,0:45:24.96,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.16,0:45:28.93,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Her Majesty wants some soft drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.67,0:45:30.83,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.44,0:45:35.47,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.97,0:45:40.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Then I'll make a simple azalea punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.35,0:45:42.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,For the first harvest
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.71,0:45:45.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Schisandra berries are well ripened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.15,0:45:48.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Brew tea from berries and sweeten with honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.92,0:45:51.92,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I’ll add pears and tangerines for freshness.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.36,0:45:54.43,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,To maintain this freshness and
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.43,0:45:56.43,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,cool the drink, add ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.09,0:45:59.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Since the azaleas have not yet bloomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.10,0:46:03.00,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I use evening primrose. We remove the pestle,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.00,0:46:04.84,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,a little starch,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:06.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,drop into boiling water
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.90,0:46:08.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and cool in cold water.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.77,0:46:11.21,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Use flowers to decorate the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.71,0:46:15.18,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,The finishing touch is three pine nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.25,0:46:24.36,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I can prepare such a drink with my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.52,0:46:25.62,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.53,0:46:32.43,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Well, I saw how you made it with your eyes wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.34,0:46:41.77,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Why is she only looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.07,0:46:44.21,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.36,0:47:01.16,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Keeping up the rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.76,0:47:08.87,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, here is your drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.27,0:47:13.14,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What? Yes. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:15.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Of course, I’m not in that position,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.27,0:47:17.98,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,but you can’t avoid it - enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.18,0:47:26.18,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.82,0:47:32.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How many more?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.19,0:47:34.39,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,At this rate we will finish by nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.39,0:47:35.49,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Until sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.99,0:47:38.10,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.10,0:47:40.40,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How dare you. Make sure you finish today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.40,0:47:42.53,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Otherwise heads will roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.60,0:47:44.64,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.94,0:47:50.47,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.47,0:47:52.01,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.01,0:47:53.14,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Tell the royal chef
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.31,0:47:56.31,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-prepare this drink for everyone who is here.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.31,0:47:58.22,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.22,0:47:59.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-For all these servants?\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.78,0:48:01.99,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.99,0:48:05.02,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-One-two, one-two.\N-One-two, one-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.83,0:48:15.30,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,She came here again, must have fallen in love with my talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.33,0:48:19.84,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll ask for more punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.67,0:48:23.01,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.01,0:48:25.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,The Queen asks you to prepare more punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.98,0:48:29.15,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I knew she would want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.55,0:48:33.65,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Did she accidentally drop the bowl because of the great taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.32,0:48:37.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Or maybe she shed a tear?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.36,0:48:43.16,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.16,0:48:45.33,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,what kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.40,0:48:49.40,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Royal Chef.\N-Royal Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.40,0:48:51.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Well, well, stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.34,0:48:54.17,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Royal chef, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.17,0:48:58.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Of course I will make a little for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:02.88,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I think you liked the drink too
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.28,0:49:05.32,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.29,0:49:12.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Did you see what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.59,0:49:14.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,That was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.30,0:49:26.90,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'll make another one. Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.14,0:49:31.28,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,While you are preparing one, will you make a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.18,0:49:35.75,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Of course. How much do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.01,0:49:39.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,-Here you go.\N-How delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.38,0:49:41.08,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.29,0:49:43.72,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.53,0:49:56.43,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,It's so expensive. Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.87,0:49:58.20,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,At least you are aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.10,0:50:02.01,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Thank you for your generosity, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.01,0:50:05.44,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Thank you for your generosity, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.61,0:50:07.78,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.28,0:50:09.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Don’t stand there, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.72,0:50:14.45,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.45,0:50:17.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,They are so easy to make work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.36,0:50:28.23,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I hide so well that even a bird won’t notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.37,0:50:33.44,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I put in so much effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.94,0:50:35.61,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,but I just wanted to drink now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.92,0:50:48.85,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You have been so busy since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.72,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Although I'm not sure what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.16,0:50:54.52,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Have you seen me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.96,0:50:58.40,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Of course. You are easy to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.56,0:50:59.56,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Easy to notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.23,0:51:02.50,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,That’s how it was intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.50,0:51:04.77,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Before that, the two court ladies did not notice me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.77,0:51:06.50,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,and talked openly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.50,0:51:09.31,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I must return to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.94,0:51:13.01,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.79,0:52:00.26,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Since I got caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.96,0:52:02.33,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,then I'll finish for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.87,0:52:11.00,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,When she saw me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.60,0:52:15.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I appeared before her like a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.18,0:52:28.39,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.83,0:52:36.96,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.77,0:52:49.21,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Do not touch with bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.56,0:53:12.96,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,A feeling that makes you want pain, -
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.56,0:53:14.56,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,love.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.52,0:53:33.18,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'll ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.65,0:53:36.79,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's nothing serious, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.79,0:53:39.19,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Ovol is not one of those who will disappear without saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.69,0:53:41.46,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I'm sure something happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.13,0:53:43.93,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.33,0:53:48.40,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.63,0:53:51.03,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.68,0:54:01.71,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Remember everything I say now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.78,0:54:05.38,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,In the whole palace you can only trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.38,0:54:07.68,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,because I’m in the same boat with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.39,0:54:12.59,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You must tell me everything, without hiding anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.69,0:54:16.69,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,This is the only way the girl and I can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.36,0:54:47.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.79,0:54:51.09,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, the chief eunuch and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.93,0:54:54.06,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.93,0:54:57.73,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,Since the queen wanted to read the “Septateuch”,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.73,0:54:59.97,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,I asked you to get me another copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.07,0:55:02.11,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.57,0:55:07.28,Default,TIRAMISU,0,0,0,,You didn’t ask me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.38,0:55:08.41,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.98,0:55:11.72,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Over the years, have you fallen ill with dementia?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.12,0:55:13.98,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I clearly remember what I ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.38,0:55:17.16,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Go to Kyujangak immediately and convey my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.75,0:55:19.69,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Do you want me to leave immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.69,0:55:21.99,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Maybe we should wait until you forget again?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.99,0:55:26.03,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I’ll just accompany you to the Daejojon hall, and get there in a jiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:30.23,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I’m not walking alone, Prince Yeonpyeong will protect me if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.23,0:55:31.80,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Why worry so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.24,0:55:33.50,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I advise you to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.44,0:55:37.71,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Yes, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.30,0:56:02.53,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Wow, did I just get killed by a wild boar?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.67,0:56:04.73,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.44,0:56:07.64,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,-Aren’t you hurt?\N-I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.21,0:56:11.24,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Looks like your nose was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.24,0:56:12.38,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,No, my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.68,0:56:14.28,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Wow, is this blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.48,0:56:16.35,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Yes, my nose is always like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.68,0:56:20.02,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Come on. Can a human nose look like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.02,0:56:21.65,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.65,0:56:23.82,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Good God. He said he was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.18,0:56:26.82,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Ovol, the missing court lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.82,0:56:28.53,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,was in the palace with Concubine Cho
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.53,0:56:30.69,Default,HAIN,0,0,0,,on the day the queen fell into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.34,0:56:33.56,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,They will force her to give false testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.70,0:56:36.40,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It all happened when the queen found out
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.40,0:56:37.57,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,that you attacked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.80,0:56:41.00,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Her target is Concubine Cho, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.41,0:56:43.44,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:45.88,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Is this what the queen wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.01,0:56:52.05,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.05,0:56:54.05,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.59,0:57:02.69,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.26,0:57:05.43,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Hwajin, you have nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.96,0:57:07.50,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.50,0:57:09.60,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.16,0:57:16.77,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,Recently I also tried to get rid of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.07,0:57:19.48,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,She takes revenge on me, that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.48,0:57:21.95,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,is trying to blame you for the incident at the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.71,0:57:25.45,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Constantly the same tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.94,0:57:28.56,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Forge evidence,\Ntrapping the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.02,0:57:33.49,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,I will tell everyone that I tried to kill the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.39,0:57:35.43,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.03,0:57:40.26,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You and I know more about revenge than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.46,0:57:42.03,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,More than return all the pain and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.03,0:57:43.43,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,That's what revenge is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.10,0:57:45.47,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The Queen is thirsty too
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:47.84,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,put the sword to Hwajin's throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.84,0:57:52.21,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,The only way to pacify her anger is
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.61,0:57:55.11,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,fall on your knees in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.58,0:57:57.71,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,There is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.82,0:58:02.72,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,She planned it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.72,0:58:04.19,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,to set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.72,0:58:06.46,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,I will intervene and put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.54,0:58:11.40,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Don’t forget about the great cause\Nto which you are striving.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.46,0:58:14.20,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Or have you already forgotten how many insults you had to endure in the last
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.20,0:58:16.10,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,2 years to properly prepare?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.33,0:58:17.53,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,For a great cause
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.12,0:58:20.30,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,you should get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.44,0:58:26.38,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Never in my life have I wanted to be a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.71,0:58:29.21,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,a puppet in the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.95,0:58:34.82,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I came to this palace for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.65,0:58:39.52,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,No more running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.50,0:58:55.64,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,No need to advise me to run again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.01,0:58:57.87,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I definitely won’t run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.28,0:59:02.31,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I'll search every crevice
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.31,0:59:04.11,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,and I will find Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.00,0:59:07.46,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Most likely, they are interrogating her somewhere in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.78,0:59:09.38,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,as soon as they beat out the confession,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.62,0:59:11.75,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,you will be punished immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.59,0:59:13.92,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Please wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.43,0:59:16.56,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,until I find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.39,0:59:18.46,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.70,0:59:21.90,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,But if something goes wrong, I will intervene immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.83,0:59:24.70,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And then don’t stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.50,0:59:27.00,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.67,0:59:29.64,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Too many lives have already been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.41,0:59:31.57,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.78,0:59:34.61,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I don’t want to lose anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:52.53,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you must take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.76,0:59:55.06,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I’ll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.63,0:59:58.06,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Kneel or crawl at their feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.06,1:00:00.34,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,pretend to be stupid, as if this is a misunderstanding, -
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.00,1:00:02.97,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I will do anything to avoid problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.91,1:00:05.94,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.83,1:00:27.26,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You all must put on your uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.92,1:00:30.20,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,We go in search of the court lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.67,1:00:32.67,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It is believed that she is in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.54,1:00:36.71,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Make sure no one sees you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:39.28,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Be extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.89,1:00:58.96,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Mortal boredom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.06,1:01:03.93,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What to do for fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.64,1:01:06.74,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.74,1:01:08.91,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The other day I managed to get
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.91,1:01:10.81,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,this silk yarn from the Qing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.58,1:01:14.18,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Do you have a warehouse in your pocket?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.18,1:01:17.75,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I thought someday you\Nwould like to return to your hobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.25,1:01:21.02,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Sorry, of course, but no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.06,1:01:22.35,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It’s worth picking up the needle,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.35,1:01:24.25,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,there is no living space left on my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.25,1:01:25.29,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.49,1:01:28.12,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I'm fully armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.53,1:01:32.36,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Have you just shown me a trick?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.46,1:01:35.73,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? This is called a thimble.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.07,1:01:38.30,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Have you decided this is a toy, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.44,1:01:40.54,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.27,1:01:42.74,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Are you really off topic?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.24,1:01:48.48,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Honyoung, and you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.64,1:01:54.98,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Does the thimble have some hidden meaning?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.28,1:01:58.42,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I prepared it so you\Ndon't prick your fingers while sewing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.76,1:02:02.02,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I am tormented by vague doubts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.20,1:02:16.74,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.74,1:02:18.34,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You're ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.28,1:02:22.22,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The king should not have run,\Nheels sparkling, he lingered.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.45,1:02:26.92,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,Is the Queen at home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.28,1:02:30.52,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I heard Her Majesty walking by the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.15,1:02:33.59,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,By the lake? Why suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.16,1:02:36.83,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho’s words coincided
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.23,1:02:40.63,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,with the words of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.30,1:02:44.33,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,She said she didn't even meet the queen that evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.33,1:02:48.67,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,That she ran away after hearing a loud sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.74,1:02:53.14,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,But whether it’s true or false, I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.71,1:02:55.04,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Only it looks like a woman,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.04,1:02:58.28,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,which was seen by the eunuch and servants who were stealing royal gifts,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:02.92,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,really was Cho’s concubine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.59,1:03:06.96,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,Or she fell into the queen's trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.72,1:03:10.83,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Before she spread her wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.70,1:03:15.73,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:18.20,Default,HAIN,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho is now in the Dongmyeongjong Hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.45,1:03:40.09,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I will protect you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.33,1:03:48.03,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,She came of her own free will.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.87,1:03:52.97,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Apparently, Ovol was closer to her than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.30,1:03:55.91,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,That’s great. It turned out to be easier than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.24,1:03:57.54,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Since she came herself,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.54,1:03:59.71,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,you must make her confess everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.18,1:04:02.65,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Health is more important to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.05,1:04:04.78,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I'll finish my meal first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.78,1:04:06.42,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.36,1:04:58.83,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Everything is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:03.57,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Mistress Hwajin would never do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.31,1:05:09.31,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me, the truth will not change.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.12,1:05:18.25,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.72,1:05:21.59,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You are like a devoted dog that licks
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.59,1:05:24.13,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,hands of the mistress about to stab you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.03,1:05:28.06,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It’s too late to admit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.07,1:05:32.77,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your mistress, Hwajin, blamed everything on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.14,1:05:37.31,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,This can’t be.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.08,1:05:46.15,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.38,1:05:48.75,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Wow, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.95,1:05:51.02,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.36,1:06:02.00,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,-God.\N-Such valuable yarn.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.06,1:06:04.03,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The eternal problem with expensive tchotchkes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.03,1:06:05.57,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,So fragile.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.40,1:06:07.47,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.04,1:06:10.71,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Let's find something stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.38,1:06:21.72,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,"Leave your false self"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:24.35,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,"Leave your false self"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.35,1:06:25.49,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.49,1:06:28.82,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You embroidered these hieroglyphs yourself when you had a free minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.09,1:06:31.46,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I don’t know what they mean, I’m illiterate,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.46,1:06:33.30,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,but I think this is a beautiful verse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.66,1:06:35.63,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've seen this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.17,1:06:39.64,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It so happens that you\Ndidn’t catch the queen doing this work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.94,1:06:42.67,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,This is a love poem?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.67,1:06:45.78,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,This is a suicide note.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.61,1:06:49.58,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Did I embroider it before I fell into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.58,1:06:51.95,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Did I understand correctly?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.95,1:06:52.98,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.02,1:06:54.22,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And I didn’t have
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.28,1:06:56.65,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,sleep problems and loss of appetite?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.82,1:06:59.29,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Were. And you sighed constantly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.29,1:07:01.09,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Always looked depressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.20,1:07:03.23,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Sometimes you started crying for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.79,1:07:07.80,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, so did you remember everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.03,1:07:09.20,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.87,1:07:13.24,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And I didn’t give away things that were dear to me to anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.04,1:07:18.41,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You gave it to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.41,1:07:19.91,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,although they used to value her very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.11,1:07:21.21,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.58,1:07:23.81,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,gave a ring to Lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.18,1:07:28.35,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.88,1:07:31.72,Default,HAIN,0,0,0,,Kim So-yeon did not try to lure her into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.42,1:07:33.69,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And I wanted to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.06,1:07:38.26,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Isn’t this Cheoljong?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.46,1:07:40.46,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The King is Coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.96,1:07:43.00,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Didn’t he say that kings shouldn’t run?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.43,1:07:46.07,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Just his face sent my blood pressure skyrocketing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.17,1:07:49.27,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.94,1:07:51.21,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.84,1:07:54.04,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Shall we settle like men?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.98,1:07:58.18,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Is that all? Is this your choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.08,1:08:00.38,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.38,1:08:02.52,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Are you making a fool of yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.69,1:08:06.59,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Have I really been deceived by your lying eyes and speeches?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.76,1:08:10.83,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,It was you who deceived me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.88,1:08:15.26,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that it was you who tried to kill me, I even slept in the same room with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.26,1:08:17.37,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,So shouldn't I be angry now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.53,1:08:19.00,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You said it yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.14,1:08:23.57,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,that only a coward attacks the weaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.02,1:08:26.31,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Are you trying to take revenge on me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.44,1:08:30.05,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,In that case, I won’t sit idly by either
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.55,1:08:33.78,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,and turn a blind eye to all your machinations.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:42.49,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.81,1:09:01.88,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.12,1:09:16.73,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What should I do
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.83,1:09:20.60,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,with this stupid weakling?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:45.05,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.40,1:09:47.16,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,If you are looking for someone to blame for what happened,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.16,1:09:48.62,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I'm ready to accept punishment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.56,1:09:53.16,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Can you clarify who I’m looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.73,1:09:58.17,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,My lady-in-waiting, Ovol, has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.77,1:10:00.07,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,What do I have to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.00,1:10:02.24,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,Do you think I did this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.38,1:10:04.66,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Because you needed something from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.04,1:10:10.75,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And I’m ready to voice what you really wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.85,1:10:14.95,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Then let's listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.12,1:10:19.36,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,When the queen fell into the lake,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.99,1:10:21.59,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I was nearby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.99,1:10:25.49,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Someday you will lose
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.66,1:10:29.16,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,person dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.85,1:10:50.29,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,For a moment my emotions got the better of me,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.76,1:10:54.89,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,and I pushed the queen into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.62,1:11:07.04,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Let me take responsibility\Nfor what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.24,1:11:10.14,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy on those\Nwho have done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:15.88,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,I will gladly accept any punishment\Nfor what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.21,1:11:19.28,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.09,1:11:28.79,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You know what this letter is about.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.19,1:11:32.90,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,You received it from the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.73,1:11:37.17,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Ovol gave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.10,1:11:41.30,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The place, date and time indicated therein,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.44,1:11:44.76,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,coincide with when and where\Nthe queen's accident occurred.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.14,1:11:47.58,Default,HEINE,0,0,0,,What do you think this means?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.08,1:11:51.61,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,This is the first time I’ve seen him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.08,1:11:57.79,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Did you really think that you could hide everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.39,1:12:01.96,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And you have a very high opinion of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.96,1:12:05.49,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You know you’re just a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.17,1:12:11.93,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.37,1:12:15.77,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,I assure you, this letter is fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.04,1:12:17.47,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,And I’m sure the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.97,1:12:19.88,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Since they are from the same Cho family,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.88,1:12:22.88,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,obviously, they decided to unite for their own goals.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.88,1:12:26.68,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother\Nnever conspired with anyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.68,1:12:30.22,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,even if they were from the same family.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.15,1:12:36.06,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Then who forged this letter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.30,1:12:42.83,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Apparently, you needed someone to support
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.37,1:12:45.47,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,your plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.97,1:12:53.08,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,The King is here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.64,1:12:56.78,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.61,1:13:00.08,Default,HAINE,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.12,1:13:02.52,Default,HEIN,0,0,0,,You have arrived. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.89,1:13:05.02,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The royal concubine confessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.79,1:13:08.36,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She said that she pushed the queen into the lake with evil intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.86,1:13:12.80,Default,XO,0,0,0,,This is all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.80,1:13:15.33,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.77,1:13:20.14,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I know that you are crazy about her,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.14,1:13:22.97,Default,XO,0,0,0,,but I can’t let you judge,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.97,1:13:24.81,Default,XO,0,0,0,,knowing that you are biased.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.24,1:13:29.28,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Are you trying to protect a criminal?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.81,1:13:32.51,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She tried to harm the queen, your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.18,1:13:35.98,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Tell him yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.39,1:13:39.09,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Who pushed the queen into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.03,1:13:52.23,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.70,1:13:53.77,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.11,1:13:59.27,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.01,1:14:05.98,Default,XO,0,0,0,,If you insist that she is simply taking someone else’s blame,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.28,1:14:09.02,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'll give you the opportunity to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:12.45,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.72,1:14:43.05,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She admitted, what are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.19,1:14:46.36,Default,XO,0,0,0,,She will be needed as a witness, take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.36,1:14:51.49,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.45,1:15:13.48,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Grab!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.74,1:15:38.57,Default,XO,0,0,0,,If you confess right here
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.57,1:15:40.08,Default,XO,0,0,0,,and agree to be beheaded,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.84,1:15:43.71,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I won’t doubt her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.59,1:15:56.09,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Cheoljong said that every night
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.09,1:15:57.69,Default,XO,0,0,0,,sees his head being cut off.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.03,1:16:00.50,Default,XO,0,0,0,,He’s clearly feeling bad now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.53,1:16:02.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,This is a failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.25,1:16:19.85,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I will reveal the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:24.12,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I will accept your will, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.75,1:16:27.92,Default,XO,0,0,0,,It’s not her who needs to be executed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.93,1:16:36.00,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.53,1:16:39.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.61,1:16:48.68,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Will you go against the will of the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.41,1:17:25.01,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Choljong, scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.25,1:17:27.42,Default,XO,0,0,0,,He's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.99,1:17:33.66,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What kind of hero is he pretending to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.89,1:17:38.93,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.26,1:17:41.63,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The lake will be filled today.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.06,1:17:43.30,Default,XO,0,0,0,,So I can return.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.40,1:17:46.40,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Hurt the queen...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.17,1:17:48.17,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:11.43,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Gods!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.50,1:18:14.66,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.66,1:18:16.87,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The water has run out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.50,1:18:18.53,Default,XO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.44,1:18:22.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.00,1:18:24.91,Default,XO,0,0,0,,We took so much water,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.91,1:18:26.74,Default,XO,0,0,0,,that the well has dried up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.91,1:18:29.64,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.11,1:18:33.55,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.75,1:19:05.85,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Allow me, as a victim of this incident,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.88,1:19:07.62,Default,XO,0,0,0,,shed light on the events.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.72,1:19:15.02,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.10,1:19:21.60,Default,XO,0,0,0,,tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.97,1:19:28.17,Default,XO,0,0,0,,You think there’s only one cool guy here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.60,1:19:30.44,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I’m the hero here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.25,1:19:39.15,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I'm coming back, so it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.05,1:19:46.32,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I ask you, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:53.43,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.40,1:20:34.97,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong entered the palace with thugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.97,1:20:36.87,Default,XO,0,0,0,,They seem to be well trained.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.87,1:20:39.47,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Problems need to be cut at the root.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.47,1:20:41.88,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The well has dried up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.88,1:20:43.41,Default,XO,0,0,0,,I believed that I should
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.41,1:20:45.65,Default,XO,0,0,0,,leave you to make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.65,1:20:47.32,Default,XO,0,0,0,,That daring look!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.32,1:20:49.32,Default,XO,0,0,0,,How dare he?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.32,1:20:51.75,Default,XO,0,0,0,,The queen’s condition is getting worse every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.75,1:20:53.39,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Maybe it’s worth asking
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.39,1:20:54.76,Default,XO,0,0,0,,depose her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.26,1:20:58.29,Default,XO,0,0,0,,Now everything will return to its place.


